    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": ", ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I like sugar, I like sweets, I don't like the spicy eats",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I need bridges in my beats and Campana Brothers seats",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "The heaven part for me is knowin' I can",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Wake up when I'm finished with my sleep, ain't no kids to feed",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "No stress I bleed, I don't got a boss",
          "rhyme": "Os",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I go wherever and don't care 'bout the cost (Nah)",
          "rhyme": "Ost",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Gas money was stark for me, uh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Now I got so many cars I could start up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "We nappin' in parks, we in the sun gettin' darked up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Chillin' with my suit on",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Travel trunk is either Moynat leather or it's Vuitton",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Sippin' mint tea like we know the tree the leaf fell from",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "We come from them Tiki Punch drinks",
          "rhyme": ")k",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Had animosity for dinner, El Pollo Loco",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "That was in the past, now I parmesan my bolo'",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Half a million driftin' and the tire readin' \"Toyo\"",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Prefer the alligator logo on my cotton polo (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Livin' it up, my niggas is up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Y'all niggas is salty peanuts, we ain't givin' a fuck",
          "rhyme": "yk",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "'Cause I'm blessed as hell and I ain't next to jail",
          "rhyme": "aj",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Ain't got no psyche hiccups, plus I dress this well",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "My heaven 24/7, that's heaven",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCDEFGGHHIJKKKKGLMNO",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABCDDEFFGGDHIIIIFJAKH"
    },
    {
