      "performer": ", , ",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "The lake water gettin' warmer from the radiant sun",
          "rhyme": "un",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "My baby mama and my daughter gettin' chased by my son",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "The water gun is in his arms, that lil' nigga could run",
          "rhyme": "(",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "He get it from his daddy side, you know, them Nigerians",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "My mama pulled up in a helicopter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Sister in the kitchen cookin', Jackson mixin' vodka",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "After dinner, I'll convince 'em they should babysit 'em",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Me and wifey gettin' ready to go see a opera (Sydney)",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "This the house we come to when we got nothin' to do",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "The big yard, quaint size with the immaculate view",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "My boat dock got a yacht with a slide on the side",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "My son and I got some bikes we could ride, I'll show him how to wheelie",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "And Wally hit my celly, we cleared another dealy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "It's no contingency, the number's in the hundred milly's (Woo-hoo-hoo)",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I'm in my fourties lookin' twenty-somethin' (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I don't ask for nothin' (Nothin')",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Everything is mwah, that's heaven for a God",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "My health is on a hundred, you feel me? Yeah",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFGFHIJKKLMMNO",
